# Delegated supervisor software interrupt smoke test.
# Host setup preloads:
# - ssip pending in the supervisor software interrupt device
# - privilege = User
# - mideleg/sie enable supervisor software interrupts
# - stvec = 0x20
# The supervisor handler clears ssip, writes x10 = 4, returns with sret,
# and user mainline resumes at PC 0 before spinning at PC 0x4.
# Expect x1 = 5, x10 = 4, scause = interrupt 1, sepc = 0, privilege = User.
